l on the left-hand side, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-2}^{\\infty }\\frac{k}{(x+3)^{7}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{k}{6(x+3)^{6}}\\,{|}_{-2}^{\\infty }=\\frac{k}{6}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this result back into the first equation and solving for $k,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{k}{6}=1\\,⟹\\,k=6.\n$$" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343681 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343682 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343683 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343684 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1000 #edb/ref 17592186343685 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1041 "selection" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1104 #edb/ref 17592186343684 13194139535322 true] [17592186343680 1110 #uuid "8c3a0a15-9719-51ca-8483-7f960c2b8bc6" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343681 1034 "12" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343681 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535322 true] [17592186343681 1111 #uuid "8b3bc02e-7ff1-55aa-8c09-1ca2afa1ed0a" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343682 1034 "10" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343682 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535322 true] [17592186343682 1111 #uuid "3aa97bad-0541-5aea-9ef2-a1670572c669" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343683 1034 "8" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343683 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535322 true] [17592186343683 1111 #uuid "fd2c70ef-e6d4-56c4-b25c-c98358523fa8" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343684 1034 "6" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343684 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535322 true] [17592186343684 1111 #uuid "d9d829d8-74d2-506e-b13e-e526b9f40473" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343685 1034 "5" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343685 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535322 true] [17592186343685 1111 #uuid "6c39349d-4f94-5f50-9e08-5a9124bb68a2" 13194139535322 true] [17592186343686 1017 #edb/ref 17592186343687 13194139535322 true] 